4,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help make the park awesome! I want to make sure we can actually get the work done on time, so I'll check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most spirited start, Kenji. While enthusiasm is a virtue, I believe a touch of pragmatism is required. I shall examine the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello! I'm happy to be here with you all. I want to know who will be taking care of the park and the plants, so I'll look at the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, and the volunteer groups.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe we should prioritize the long-term viability of the project over initial impressions. I will examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure we are mindful of the future, I shall look into the terms of the regional habitat fund and the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds like a great plan, everyone! I think it's awesome that we're looking at everything from the plants to the money. I'm really curious to see if the firms can actually handle the digging!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. It would be a tragedy to select a vision of paradise only to discover that the local machinery is incapable of carving it from the earth. I suspect the reality of the soil is far less cooperative.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I hope the people who work there are happy too. It's nice that we are all looking at different things to help the park. I wonder if the volunteers like the park as much as we do!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"It is important that we remain objective. While the human element is valuable, the physical evidence of past projects will tell us the most about the city's ability to maintain its promises over time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minako. The records of the past often whisper the truths that the present chooses to ignore. I hope our findings bring us a sense of clarity and peace.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I totally agree with Jonathan! I can't wait to see what the records tell us. I just hope the digging part doesn't turn into a giant mess that takes forever to fix!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,A giant mess is precisely what occurs when one mistakes a brochure for a blueprint. I shall be quite interested to see if the drainage records reveal a park that breathes or one that merely drowns in August.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the park breathes too! I think it would be wonderful if the people and the plants could all grow together happily. I'm looking forward to learning more about everyone's work.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"We are all seeking different forms of stability. Whether it is the soil, the budget, or the staff, the goal is the same: a result that lasts. I look forward to seeing if the physical evidence supports our hopes.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a comforting thought, Minako. When we align our ambitions with the quiet reality of the archives, we avoid the turbulence of unexpected burdens. I wish you all a productive search for the truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready to dive in! I'll do my best to find out if we can get those diggers moving without any big surprises. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall await the revelations of the ledgers with a measured curiosity. Let us hope the data is more honest than the architects' renderings. Until we reconvene, I wish you all a most illuminating investigation.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'm ready too! I hope I can find out if there are enough kind people to help the park stay beautiful. I'll see you all soon!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready to proceed. I will focus on the evidence of durability and the actual outcomes of previous schemes to ensure our decision is grounded in reality. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall now step into the quiet of the records. May we find a path that is not only beautiful but sustainable for the years to come. I look forward to our next meeting.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
